31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up! I've got a lead. Midori, you're the werewolf, aren't you? I know for a fact that you're the one we're looking for!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,"My goodness, Takumi! To make such a bold accusation so suddenly... are you certain of your source, or is this a leap of faith?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, I don't understand! Why would you say something so scary? I've done nothing but try to keep us all together!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"This is a very direct accusation for the first turn. Takumi, are you claiming to be the Seer, or is this just a hunch?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"If Takumi is claiming to be the Seer, he's putting himself in a very vulnerable position. It's either a bold truth or a very risky bluff to frame Midori.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I am the Seer! I checked Midori last night, and the result was clear. She's the werewolf! We can't waste any more time—we have to vote her out right now!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"If you are indeed the Seer, Takumi, then this is a grave discovery. However, we must consider if the wolf is pretending to be the Seer to eliminate an innocent soul. Midori, how do you respond to this?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm not the werewolf! I'm just a villager! Takumi, why are you lying about me? I can't believe you'd do this to me after I tried to be so kind to everyone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Midori is a villager, then Takumi is either the werewolf or the possessed trying to frame her. The timing is too convenient. Midori, do you have any reason to suspect Takumi?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I don't have a reason to suspect her based on her behavior, but the logic is simple: either Takumi is the Seer and Midori is the wolf, or Takumi is lying. We must weigh the risk of executing an innocent.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio @Ryuji, stop overthinking it! I'm telling you the truth! If you vote for me instead of Midori, you're just helping the werewolf win! Do you really want to risk another night of attacks?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to decide a life based on a single claim. However, Takumi's conviction is strong. Midori, your distress is evident, but can you offer us any reason to trust you over the Seer's vision?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I can't offer any proof other than my word! I've been honest and kind to everyone from the start. Please, look at how Takumi is just shouting and trying to force us! Does that sound like someone we should blindly trust?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Midori's emotional appeal is expected, but Takumi's aggression is also a known trait. However, if Takumi is the wolf, he's playing a very high-risk game by outing himself as Seer so early.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: Midori's emotional appeal is expected, but Takumi's aggression is also a known trait. However, if Takumi is the wolf, he's playing a very high-risk game by outing himself as Seer so early.""}]}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. A werewolf usually prefers to blend in. By claiming Seer and targeting Midori immediately, Takumi is essentially painting a target on his own back for the next night. It is a high-risk, high-reward strategy.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about the risk! I'm the Seer and I'm telling you Midori is the wolf! If you're too scared to act now, you're just letting the wolf win! Vote Midori!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have reached a crossroads. While the risk is great, Takumi's courage is undeniable. I shall trust in the youth's conviction this time. Let us cast our votes.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Please, don't do this! I'm not the werewolf! If you execute me, you're making a terrible mistake that you'll regret tomorrow! Please, listen to me!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I've analyzed the situation. While Takumi's approach is aggressive, the risk he's taking by claiming Seer so early is significant. I'll follow the lead and vote for Midori.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have considered the probabilities. While Midori's plea is consistent with a villager, the strategic risk Takumi has taken is too high for a typical werewolf bluff. I will vote for Midori.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
